# Every scheduled task in Get-ScheduledTask's order with its state, and every
# detail of the tasks tools/windows-state.ps1 registers (D80,
# SPEC-QUESTIONS T3-2): folders, never run, disabled, hidden, ran, failed,
# running, a trigger in the future and one in the past.
get system information "tasks" into tasks
for each task in tasks
    say name of task "-" state of task
.
for each task in tasks
    if name of task starts with "Otter" or name of task starts with "otter"
        say name of task "|" state of task "|" lastRunTime of task "|" nextRunTime of task
    .
.
